# sapintegrationsuite_provider_features (Data Source)

Returns the feature catalog compiled into this provider version: every SAP Integration Suite
capability that was evaluated, with its support status, the contract it rests on, the operations
implemented and the known limitations. It describes the provider, not your tenant, and needs no
SAP credentials. Use it to check in a pipeline that the features a configuration relies on are
supported by the pinned provider version.

**Status:** supported. Needs no SAP connection.

Always returns the whole catalog.

